`the caveator's conveyance while the caveat stands` MEANS LaterAssurance WITH
    `in favour of the person the caveat names or the person who lodged it` IS TRUE
    `conveys the same estate or interest as the caveat describes` IS TRUE
    `presented and accepted while the caveat was in force` IS TRUE

`the caveator's conveyance after the caveat lapsed` MEANS LaterAssurance WITH
    `in favour of the person the caveat names or the person who lodged it` IS TRUE
    `conveys the same estate or interest as the caveat describes` IS TRUE
    `presented and accepted while the caveat was in force` IS FALSE

`a conveyance to a stranger while the caveat stands` MEANS LaterAssurance WITH
    `in favour of the person the caveat names or the person who lodged it` IS FALSE
    `conveys the same estate or interest as the caveat describes` IS TRUE
    `presented and accepted while the caveat was in force` IS TRUE

`the caveator's lease where the caveat claimed a purchase` MEANS LaterAssurance WITH
    `in favour of the person the caveat names or the person who lodged it` IS TRUE
    `conveys the same estate or interest as the caveat describes` IS FALSE
    `presented and accepted while the caveat was in force` IS TRUE

`an earlier deed registered later` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `date of registration` IS 20
    `date of execution` IS 1
    `registered at the same moment as a competing instrument` IS FALSE
    `the person registering is a party to actual fraud` IS FALSE
    `the person registering had actual or constructive notice of the earlier interest` IS FALSE
    `claims without valuable consideration` IS FALSE
    `would be fraudulent and void if unregistered` IS FALSE

`a later deed registered first` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `date of registration` IS 10
    `date of execution` IS 5
    `registered at the same moment as a competing instrument` IS FALSE
    `the person registering is a party to actual fraud` IS FALSE
    `the person registering had actual or constructive notice of the earlier interest` IS FALSE
    `claims without valuable consideration` IS FALSE
    `would be fraudulent and void if unregistered` IS FALSE

`a deed registered the same day` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `date of registration` IS 10
    `date of execution` IS 3
    `registered at the same moment as a competing instrument` IS FALSE
    `the person registering is a party to actual fraud` IS FALSE
    `the person registering had actual or constructive notice of the earlier interest` IS FALSE
    `claims without valuable consideration` IS FALSE
    `would be fraudulent and void if unregistered` IS FALSE

`a registered deed taken with notice` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `date of registration` IS 10
    `date of execution` IS 5
    `registered at the same moment as a competing instrument` IS FALSE
    `the person registering is a party to actual fraud` IS FALSE
    `the person registering had actual or constructive notice of the earlier interest` IS TRUE
    `claims without valuable consideration` IS FALSE
    `would be fraudulent and void if unregistered` IS FALSE

`a registered deed procured by the registrant's fraud` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `date of registration` IS 10
    `date of execution` IS 5
    `registered at the same moment as a competing instrument` IS FALSE
    `the person registering is a party to actual fraud` IS TRUE
    `the person registering had actual or constructive notice of the earlier interest` IS TRUE
    `claims without valuable consideration` IS FALSE
    `would be fraudulent and void if unregistered` IS FALSE

`a registered conveyance in fraud of creditors` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `date of registration` IS 10
    `date of execution` IS 5
    `registered at the same moment as a competing instrument` IS FALSE
    `the person registering is a party to actual fraud` IS FALSE
    `the person registering had actual or constructive notice of the earlier interest` IS FALSE
    `claims without valuable consideration` IS FALSE
    `would be fraudulent and void if unregistered` IS TRUE

`a registered gift` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `date of registration` IS 12
    `date of execution` IS 11
    `registered at the same moment as a competing instrument` IS FALSE
    `the person registering is a party to actual fraud` IS FALSE
    `the person registering had actual or constructive notice of the earlier interest` IS FALSE
    `claims without valuable consideration` IS TRUE
    `would be fraudulent and void if unregistered` IS FALSE

`an advance under an all-monies mortgage` MEANS Advance WITH
    `the advance is made by a prior mortgagee` IS TRUE
    `the prior mortgage authorises further advances or revolving credit` IS TRUE
    `the subsequent mortgagee agreed` IS FALSE
    `the subsequent mortgagee merely knew and did not object` IS FALSE

`an advance with the second mortgagee's consent` MEANS Advance WITH
    `the advance is made by a prior mortgagee` IS TRUE
    `the prior mortgage authorises further advances or revolving credit` IS FALSE
    `the subsequent mortgagee agreed` IS TRUE
    `the subsequent mortgagee merely knew and did not object` IS FALSE

`an advance the second mortgagee knew of` MEANS Advance WITH
    `the advance is made by a prior mortgagee` IS TRUE
    `the prior mortgage authorises further advances or revolving credit` IS FALSE
    `the subsequent mortgagee agreed` IS FALSE
    `the subsequent mortgagee merely knew and did not object` IS TRUE

`an advance under a fixed-sum mortgage` MEANS Advance WITH
    `the advance is made by a prior mortgagee` IS TRUE
    `the prior mortgage authorises further advances or revolving credit` IS FALSE
    `the subsequent mortgagee agreed` IS FALSE
    `the subsequent mortgagee merely knew and did not object` IS FALSE

`an advance by a stranger` MEANS Advance WITH
    `the advance is made by a prior mortgagee` IS FALSE
    `the prior mortgage authorises further advances or revolving credit` IS TRUE
    `the subsequent mortgagee agreed` IS TRUE
    `the subsequent mortgagee merely knew and did not object` IS FALSE

