§ `s 14 -- priority by registration`

#ASSERT `the first ranks ahead of the second by registration date` `a later deed registered first` `an earlier deed registered later`
#ASSERT NOT `the first ranks ahead of the second by registration date` `an earlier deed registered later` `a later deed registered first`
#ASSERT NOT `the first ranks ahead of the second by registration date` `a deed registered the same day` `a later deed registered first`
#ASSERT `the first ranks ahead of the second by registration date` `a registered deed taken with notice` `an earlier deed registered later`
#ASSERT NOT `the Act determines priority between the two` `a deed registered the same day` `a later deed registered first`
#ASSERT `the Act determines priority between the two` `an earlier deed registered later` `a later deed registered first`
#ASSERT `the instrument keeps the priority its registration gives` `an earlier deed registered later`
#ASSERT `the instrument keeps the priority its registration gives` `a later deed registered first`
#ASSERT `the instrument keeps the priority its registration gives` `a deed registered the same day`
#ASSERT `the instrument keeps the priority its registration gives` `a registered deed taken with notice`
#ASSERT NOT `the instrument keeps the priority its registration gives` `a registered deed procured by the registrant's fraud`
#ASSERT NOT `the instrument keeps the priority its registration gives` `a registered conveyance in fraud of creditors`
#ASSERT `the instrument keeps the priority its registration gives` `a registered gift`
#ASSERT NOT `notice of the earlier interest costs the instrument its priority` `a registered deed taken with notice`
#ASSERT `notice of the earlier interest costs the instrument its priority` `a registered deed procured by the registrant's fraud`
#ASSERT NOT `notice of the earlier interest costs the instrument its priority` `a later deed registered first`
#ASSERT `the volunteer enjoys full priority` `a registered gift` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the volunteer enjoys full priority` `a registered gift` FALSE
#ASSERT `the volunteer enjoys full priority` `a later deed registered first` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the volunteer enjoys full priority` `a registered conveyance in fraud of creditors` TRUE

§ `s 15 -- tacking`

#ASSERT `the further advance ranks ahead of the subsequent mortgage` `an advance under an all-monies mortgage`
#ASSERT `the further advance ranks ahead of the subsequent mortgage` `an advance with the second mortgagee's consent`
#ASSERT NOT `the further advance ranks ahead of the subsequent mortgage` `an advance the second mortgagee knew of`
#ASSERT NOT `the further advance ranks ahead of the subsequent mortgage` `an advance under a fixed-sum mortgage`
#ASSERT NOT `the further advance ranks ahead of the subsequent mortgage` `an advance by a stranger`

§ `s 16 -- relief`

#ASSERT `the claimant has the grantor's grounds of relief` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the claimant has the grantor's grounds of relief` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the claimant has the grantor's grounds of relief` TRUE FALSE
